{"version":1,"content":"<p>派拉蒙影業為《憤怒的小鳥3大電影》公佈了一張新宣傳海報。海報採用拼貼網格構圖，視覺設計明顯借鑑了Rockstar Games遊戲封面的語言，並以《GTA6》的風格作為宣傳噱頭。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/comic/1586948.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.056839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:07:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.129044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:20.129044+00:00","content_hash":"45e427f6437cf9bef22be80c36f67359494d234c44289bf03832f501c4b84b0d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}